("webops-web-performance","analyzing lab and field website performance as distinct evidence classes","SearchBridge PageSpeed/CrUX, Lens environment-relative metrics, and prior runs",["Label each metric lab, field, or local environment-relative.","Validate device/form factor, URL/origin, collection period, and comparable configuration.","Compare distributions/percentiles separately from lab audits.","Connect regressions to changes only when evidence supports the relationship."],["lab results","field results","comparison","bounded hypotheses"],"Do not merge lab and field values or infer causation from timing alone."),
