("webops-link-health","auditing broken, redirected, malformed, or unexpected links","SiteProbe link/status/redirect evidence and optional Lens interactions",["Validate crawl coverage and response timestamps.","Separate internal breakage, outbound observation, redirect chains, malformed URLs, and unexpected destinations.","Recheck transient external failures conservatively.","Propose exact source/target repairs and verify under authorized ACT."],["link inventory findings","redirect chains","transient/confirmed labels","repair brief"],"Do not crawl cross-origin sites broadly or equate one timeout with permanent failure."),
("webops-competitor-intelligence","monitoring selected public competitors or peers for meaningful change","Public web evidence, bounded SiteProbe runs, optional SearchBridge estimates, and prior baseline",["Use an explicit peer list and lawful public scope.","Compare topics, positioning, structure, notable content, search presence, and available backlinks.","Separate observed change, third-party estimate, and analyst inference.","Explain relevance without recommending imitation by default."],["peer change log","evidence URLs","relevance assessment","unknowns"],"Do not infer private strategy or bypass crawl restrictions."),
